<p>Lemon Lagoon is a short game about serving refreshing drinks to thirsty guests and expanding the menu as the party gets busier. It was made as a team entry for Comfy Jam: Summer and is released for free on <a href="https://fungusflip.itch.io/lemon-lagoon" target="_blank" rel="noopener">itch.io</a>.</p>

